==Description==
The '''Firework Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 26 of the premium [[Operation I.C.E Event#Operation I.C.E Event Battle Pass|Operation I.C.E Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{Bell|860}} or {{Robux|82}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bell|10,670}} or {{Robux|2,532}}.

The '''Firework Nametag''' has red and green striped text and a translucent gradient with identical colors. Behind the nametag, multiple firework explosions can be seen, all of which are themed around Christmas.

